    "# 01: Preprocessing, Adult Income Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Transforms the raw UCI Adult census file (Kohavi, 1996) into the analysis\n",
    "dataset specified in Ch. 3, binary target (income >$50K = 1, base rate ~24%),\n",
    "and explicit binary fairness attribute `sex_female` (female = protected\n",
    "subgroup per Ch. 3).\n",
    "\n",
    "Raw input: s3://osilesi-dissertation-data/raw/adult.data (never modified).\n",
    "Output: s3://osilesi-dissertation-data/processed/adult_final_pruned.csv"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "798e13b8-363d-4112-a3e9-16739a07c047",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
