   "source": [
    "## Missing value strategy\n",
    "\n",
    "Adult encodes missingness as \"?\" (workclass ~1,836; occupation ~1,843;\n",
    "native_country ~583). Rows are NOT dropped: \"?\" is recoded to an explicit \"Unknown\" category,\n",
    "which survives one-hot encoding as its own indicator column."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "3743e024-2845-403e-9af2-90dc09653353",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "adult = adult.replace(\"?\", \"Unknown\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "dc72ce6e-def6-4776-9655-36fc476b6936",
   "metadata": {},
